==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|halda}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*haldaną}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈhalta/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|alta|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|hélt|héldu|haldið}}

# to [[hold]] (+ dative)
#: {{ux|is|Hún '''hélt''' barninu þétt að sér.|She '''held''' the baby close.}}
# to [[think]] (have an opinion)
#: {{ux|is|Já, ég '''held''' það.|Yes, I '''think''' so.}}
#: {{ux|is|Nei, ég '''held''' ekki.|No, I don't '''think''' so.}}
#: {{ux|is|'''Heldur'''ðu að útvarpið sé bilað?|Do you '''think''' the radio's broken?}}

