==Norwegian Nynorsk==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|nn|halde}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nn|non|halda}}, from {{inh|nn|gem-pro|*haldaną}}. Akin to {{cog|en|hold}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|no|/²hɑldɑ/}}

===Verb===
{{head|nn|verb|cat2=strong verbs|cat3=class 7 strong verbs|present tense|held|past tense|heldt|supine|halde|past participle|halden|present participle|haldande|imperative|hald|or|haldt}}

# to [[hold]]
#: {{ux|nn|Kva '''held''' du på?|What are you '''holding'''?}}
'''halda fram'''
# to [[continue]]
'''halda seg'''
# to [[endure]], [[keep]]
#: {{ux|nn|Kor lenge '''held''' denne mjølka '''seg'''?|How long will this milk '''keep'''?}}
#: {{usex|nn|Eg må på do. Eg klarer ikkje å '''halda meg''' lenger.|I need the toilet. I can not '''keep''' it in any longer.}}
'''halda til'''
# to [[stay]] somewhere, be somewhere
#: {{ux|nn|Han '''held til''' i ei hytte i skogen.|He '''is staying''' in a cabin in the woods.}}

